  m_Name: DadRepeated
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NarratorEventData
  eventID: DadRepeated
  dialogueLines:
  - "Okay, you\u2019ve already talked to your dad. There are other things to do"
  - "Right, you\u2019ve had your little chat with your dad. Time to move on"
  - Okay, I think your dad has heard enough from you for now. Go do something else
  - "You\u2019ve already talked to your dad. Surely you can find something else to
    do"
  - "Alright, dad has been sufficiently bothered. Let\u2019s go find something else"
  - "Okay, you\u2019ve made your point. There\u2019s an entire facility out there,
    you know"
  - "You\u2019ve already spoken to your dad. Please tell me you\u2019re not planning
    on doing it again"
  - "Right, that\u2019s enough father-player bonding for one day. Go explore something
    else"
  - Okay, we get it, you like talking to your dad. Now please move on
  - "You\u2019ve already talked to your dad. I\u2019m begging you to discover literally
    anything else"
